@startuml
!include common-style.puml

title State Machine — Invoice Status

skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  BorderColor #334155
  FontColor #111827
  FontSize 14
  StartColor #0F766E
  EndColor #B91C1C
  ArrowColor #455A64
}

[*] --> UNPAID : Cashier creates invoice\n(POST /api/v1/invoices)\npaidAmount = 0

UNPAID --> PARTIAL : Partial payment recorded\n(paidAmount < totalAmount)
UNPAID --> PAID : Full payment in one step\n(paidAmount == totalAmount)
UNPAID --> CANCELLED : Invoice voided

PARTIAL --> PARTIAL : Additional partial payment
PARTIAL --> PAID : Remaining balance paid
PARTIAL --> CANCELLED : Invoice voided

PAID --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]

note right of UNPAID
Invoice is created only if:
- Visit status = DONE
- No existing invoice for visit
end note

note right of PARTIAL
Each payment creates a Payment record.
paidAmount is cumulative sum.
Overpayment rejected (BR-16).
end note

note right of CANCELLED
CANCELLED invoices cannot receive
further payments.
end note

@enduml
